@startuml
title FEATURE-004 Password Reset - Sequence

actor User
participant "UI\n/request-password-reset" as UIRequest
participant "usePasswordResetRequest" as HookRequest
participant "PasswordResetService" as Service
participant "API\n/send-password-reset-email" as ApiSend
participant "Email Provider" as Email

participant "API\n/password-reset" as ApiReset
participant "UI\n/password-reset" as UIReset
participant "usePasswordReset" as HookReset

User -> UIRequest : Saisit email + submit
UIRequest -> HookRequest : requestReset(email)
HookRequest -> Service : requestPasswordReset(email)
Service -> ApiSend : POST send-password-reset-email
ApiSend -> Email : send reset email
Email --> ApiSend : sent/error
ApiSend --> Service : success/error code
Service --> HookRequest : result
HookRequest --> UIRequest : state (success/error/countdown)

User -> UIReset : Ouvre lien reset (oobCode)
UIReset -> HookReset : submitNewPassword(oobCode, newPassword)
HookReset -> Service : confirmPasswordReset(...)
Service -> ApiReset : POST password-reset
ApiReset --> Service : success / EXPIRED_OOB_CODE / INVALID_OOB_CODE
Service --> HookReset : result
HookReset --> UIReset : success OR redirect failure

@enduml
